# Look at the coil and bed ("bore" set) in a window, without any acquisition. From the GATE project folder:
#     Gate --qt coil3_bed/vis_bore.mac
# If your GATE has no OGLSQt viewer, change OGLSQt to OGLI on the visDriver line below.
/control/alias coilParts bore
/control/alias visDriver OGLSQt
/control/execute coil3_bed/vis_common.mac
